' A file written with RapidQ's names: completion offers RapidQ's names
' (RapidR's own components under RapidR's), so the file never mixes them
' (R-NAMES); hovers still say RapidR's name.
CREATE Form AS QFORM
    CREATE Go AS QBUTTON
    END CREATE
END CREATE
DIM n AS |
Go.Capt|ion = "x"
'! 1 completion has QButton QForm QStringGrid RPlot INTEGER
'! 1 completion lacks RButton RForm RStringGrid
'! 2 hover has "RButton.Caption"
